  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM WASH Officer T&#xFC;rkiye and cross-border operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assignment at the request of the International Organization for Migration (IOM).IOM T&#xFC;rkiye is currently looking to establish a WASH team in earthquake affected areas, in order to meet the (East, Southeast, and Mediterranean (ESEM)) regions&apos; urgent humanitarian needs.The selected Programme Officer (WASH) will provide support in the implementation and monitoring of WASH related activities in both T&#xFC;rkiye and cross-border operations.</narrative>
  </description>
